{"repositoryId":448379998,"availability":"available","full":"pierre-lgb/slashwriter","name":"slashwriter","description":"App for editing and sharing documents online, with a Notion-like block-based collaborative editor.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":97,"forks":9,"created":"2022-01-15T20:09:30Z","updated":"2024-04-27T19:17:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://slashwriter.fly.dev","topics":["collaborative-editing","editor","nextjs","supabase","tiptap"],"demo":"https://slashwriter.fly.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.575Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.575Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.575Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.575Z","stars":97,"forks":9}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Slashwriter is a tool for creating, organizing, and sharing documents online. Its block-based collaborative editor, which is easy to use, is designed to help you create high-quality documents while saving you time.","It was created using NextJS and Supabase, as well as a lot of modules detailed in the package.json file."],"features":["Commands. To add content to your document, you can use commands. By typing / in the editor, the list of commands appears. For example, /title allows you to add a title, and /bold allows you to make text bold.","Block Editor. The editor organizes your document into blocks: paragraphs, headings, images, tables, etc. By hovering over one of these blocks, the handle (⠿) that appears allows you to drag and drop them to another part…","Embedded Documents. To organize your documents, you can embed sub-documents within a document using the /document command. When a document becomes too long, moving the content of a section into embedded documents makes…","Markdown. The editor is compatible with markdown commands to make writing faster. For example, #, ##, and ### can be used to create titles and subheadings."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pierre-lgb/slashwriter/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ea609999e0c1afe493d09abe2d5b82290942301dd570dbbee28422123bcaed7f","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.881Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.881Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Slashwriter is a tool for creating, organizing, and sharing documents online. Its block-based collaborative editor, which is easy to use, is designed to help you create high-quality documents while saving you time.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pierre-lgb/slashwriter/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ea609999e0c1afe493d09abe2d5b82290942301dd570dbbee28422123bcaed7f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pierre-lgb/slashwriter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.881Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-04-27T19:17:22Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pierre-lgb/slashwriter/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T08:23:25.882Z","hash":"ea609999e0c1afe493d09abe2d5b82290942301dd570dbbee28422123bcaed7f","originalBytes":3245,"storedBytes":3245,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["supabase","run","file","start","npm","document","editor","documents","next","public","stop","allows","been","installed","npx","postgres","supabase-cli","url","add","anon","app","blocks","commands","commands.","content","create","dbname","demo","embedded","environment","example","init","key","local","locally","make","postgresql","rename","repository","server","set","setup","slashwriter","tiptap-pro-placeholder","title","using","variables","which","after","another","appears","appears.","auth.sql","available","becomes","block","block-based","bold","bold.","build","cli","cmd","collaborative","command","command.","compatible","console","cover","created","creating","cron.sql","database","designed","detailed","dev","development","directory","docker","docker.","document.","documents.","documen